OL,3,GNEWSASerial sex offender, 24, jailed
OL,4,Afor abuse including rape when he was 16
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender who repeatedly raped and
OL,7,Fabused two women over a four-year
OL,8,Fperiod has been jailed for 12 years.
OL,10,FCalvin Mitchell, 24, - who targeted the
OL,11,Ffirst of his victims when he was 16 -
OL,12,Fwas convicted of 14 offences, including
OL,13,Fsix charges of rape.
OL,15,FMitchell, formerly of Kirkcaldy, Fife,
OL,16,Fhad denied a series of charges.
OL,18,FBut at the High Court in Edinburgh the
OL,19,Fjudge, Thomas Welsh KC, said he had
OL,20,Fbeen convicted of "grave and serious"
OL,21,Foffences.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
